# Warrior animation machine. The game sets two parameters each update:
#   moving: 1 while the player moves, 0 while it stands still
#   facing: 0 down, 1 right, 2 up, 3 left
# A state plays the first clip variant whose condition holds. A transition fires when its condition holds and
# crossfades the clips it leaves over its blend time, in seconds. Clip names come from warrior.anim.
machine 1
param moving
param facing
state idle
clip idle_down when facing == 0
clip idle_right when facing == 1
clip idle_up when facing == 2
clip idle_left when facing == 3
state walk
clip walk_down when facing == 0
clip walk_right when facing == 1
clip walk_up when facing == 2
clip walk_left when facing == 3
start idle
transition idle -> walk when moving == 1 blend 0.1
transition walk -> idle when moving == 0 blend 0.1
